{"title":"How Far I_ll Go","artist":"Moana","sourceId":"reference:O4QZlpg9hBPKrTWXBwE3","sourceHash":"609e7b19e85828c67dd5214edc265b5aa208f08575d3422bba6296fc240e96a7","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":37182136,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":14.48,"end":18.54,"text":"I've been staring at the edge of the water","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":18.54,"end":21.89,"text":"'Long as I can remember","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":21.89,"end":26.23,"text":"Never really knowing why","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":26.23,"end":30.68,"text":"I wish I could be the perfect daughter","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":30.68,"end":33.51,"text":"But I come back to the water","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":33.51,"end":37.86,"text":"No matter how hard I try","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":37.86,"end":39.35,"text":"Every turn I take","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":39.35,"end":40.87,"text":"Every trail I track","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":40.87,"end":42.42,"text":"Every path I make","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":42.42,"end":43.85,"text":"Every road leads back","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":43.85,"end":46.73,"text":"To the place I know where I cannot go","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":46.73,"end":49.52,"text":"Where I long to be","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":49.52,"end":52.04,"text":"See the line where the sky meets the sea?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":52.04,"end":54.5,"text":"It calls me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":54.5,"end":57.4,"text":"And no one knows","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":57.4,"end":61.01,"text":"How far it goes","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":61.01,"end":65.92,"text":"If the wind in my sail on the sea stays behind me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":65.92,"end":69.43,"text":"One day I'll know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":69.43,"end":73.09,"text":"If I go, there's just no telling how far I'll go","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":73.09,"end":76.68,"text":"I know everybody on this island","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":76.68,"end":79.78,"text":"Seems so happy on this island","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":79.78,"end":84.15,"text":"Everything is by design","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":84.15,"end":88.2,"text":"I know everybody on this island","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":88.2,"end":91.13,"text":"Has a role on this island","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":91.13,"end":95.03999999999999,"text":"So maybe I can roll with mine","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":95.03999999999999,"end":96.66,"text":"I can lead with pride","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":96.66,"end":98.19,"text":"I can make us strong","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":98.19,"end":100.97999999999999,"text":"I'll be satisfied if I play along","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":100.97999999999999,"end":103.9,"text":"But the voice inside sings a different song","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":103.9,"end":106.08,"text":"What is wrong with me?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":109.39,"end":111.96000000000001,"text":"See the light as it shines on the sea?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":111.96000000000001,"end":114.53999999999999,"text":"It's blinding","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":114.53999999999999,"end":117.59,"text":"But no one knows","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":117.59,"end":120.89,"text":"How deep it goes","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":120.89,"end":123.13,"text":"And it seems like it's calling out to me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":123.13,"end":125.9,"text":"So come find me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":125.9,"end":129.56,"text":"And let me know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":129.56,"end":131.0,"text":"What's beyond that line?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":131.0,"end":132.47,"text":"Will I cross that line?","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":132.47,"end":134.89,"text":"And the line where the sky meets the sea","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":134.89,"end":137.54,"text":"It calls me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":137.54,"end":140.5,"text":"And no one knows","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":140.5,"end":143.61,"text":"How far it goes","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":143.61,"end":148.99,"text":"If the wind in my sail on the sea stays behind me","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":148.99,"end":151.71,"text":"One day I'll know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":151.71,"end":156.59,"text":"How far I'll go","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}